# Eterna Forest, the Lost Tower and the Solaceon Ruins (the original's D_02 role): a hushed A-minor wander under
# the trees, the flute over a harp that keeps walking, glints of light on the celesta and a soft heartbeat on the
# toms; a little eerie, never frightening. Original composition for this game.
